00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:44.004
Let me explain.

00:19:44.004 --> 00:19:45.380
That's not fair.

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:46.959
I do have something to do with it.

00:19:46.959 --> 00:19:49.304
I'm (claps) the match of what's happening

00:19:49.304 --> 00:19:50.860
with the #AskGaryVee Show.

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:54.319
But the truth is, to really
get what I want out of it,

00:19:54.319 --> 00:19:57.431
I want to build a comminity.

00:19:57.431 --> 00:19:59.474
A community can not be built

00:19:59.474 --> 00:20:02.608
predicated on a dictatorship

00:20:02.608 --> 00:20:04.164
or an individual.

00:20:04.164 --> 00:20:05.906
It needs to be predicated on the fact

00:20:05.906 --> 00:20:08.204
that people are communicating
with each other.

00:20:08.204 --> 00:20:10.573
What you haven't realized yet, Mike,

00:20:10.573 --> 00:20:13.870
is that if you look deeply into
what's going on on Instagram

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:16.401
and YouTube and Facebook

00:20:16.401 --> 00:20:19.140
