doing the wrong version of it.

00:20:25.108 --> 00:20:27.267
Which they're in there
communicating with the other people

00:20:27.267 --> 00:20:30.634
for their own interest in
mind to siphon them into--

00:20:30.634 --> 00:20:33.374
If Webly was to do that, she's
in there 'cause she wants

00:20:33.374 --> 00:20:35.788
some of the other small business
people to take her services

00:20:35.788 --> 00:20:37.878
and that's all she wants
in a right hook, right hook

00:20:37.878 --> 00:20:39.596
right hook, right hook way.

00:20:39.596 --> 00:20:42.406
25 of you, I'm paying attention,
are playing that game.

00:20:42.406 --> 00:20:44.797
15 of you are not,
you're playing more of a

00:20:44.797 --> 00:20:46.957
jab, jab, jab, right hook game

00:20:46.957 --> 00:20:48.303
and let's just remind everybody,

00:20:48.303 --> 00:20:49.418
Jab, Jab, Jab, Right Hook

00:20:49.418 --> 00:20:51.090
to that person that
emailed and said they were

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:52.227
disappointed in me,

00:20:52.227 --> 00:20:53.830
that is a game that plays like this.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.455
Jab, jab, jab, right hook.

00:20:55.455 --> 00:20:57.034
The right hook is not

00:20:57.034 --> 00:20:58.102
you get the sale.

00:20:58.102 --> 00:20:59.054
The right hook is

00:20:59.054 --> 00:21:02.815
you've been given the permission
to have a chance to sell.

00:21:02.815 --> 00:21:05.625
So, when you jab, jab, jab and right hook

00:21:05.625 --> 00:21:08.132
you go for your right hook
but you're not disappointed.

00:21:08.132 --> 00:21:10.454
I have not even asked
any single person here

00:21:10.454 --> 00:21:13.171
what the update is on how
many books have come in.

00:21:13.171 --> 00:21:17.490
It's just not the part, it's
the permission that it created,

00:21:17.490 --> 00:21:20.331
not necessarily what the
results are just yet.

00:21:20.331 --> 00:21:24.717
The real reason you should
be commenting on this show

00:21:24.717 --> 00:21:27.573
is because you'd start putting
out content on your two cents

00:21:27.573 --> 00:21:31.242
