those comments, plenty.

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:38.347
More of you should be.

00:21:38.347 --> 00:21:40.344
And then you start
engaging with each other.

00:21:40.344 --> 00:21:43.223
And out of that serendipity,
much like on Wine Library TV,

00:21:43.223 --> 00:21:47.124
where there are over 20
different wine tasting groups

00:21:47.124 --> 00:21:49.515
right now that have been
hanging out with each other

00:21:49.515 --> 00:21:54.159
for the last seven to ten
years drinking wine together,

00:21:54.159 --> 00:21:58.176
once out of every, once a
month on every third Wednesday

00:21:58.176 --> 00:22:00.985
