and have built their

00:22:00.985 --> 00:22:03.818
disproportionate best
friends out of being part

00:22:03.818 --> 00:22:06.651
of a community of a web
show started by some kid

00:22:06.651 --> 00:22:08.880
in New Jersey talking about wine.

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:10.969
The community that's being
built underneath here.

00:22:10.969 --> 00:22:13.570
The way that these three get
to interact with each other

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:16.078
for the rest of their lives
on this connection point

00:22:16.078 --> 00:22:18.353
and the way that you guys
all have the ability,

00:22:18.353 --> 00:22:23.027
if you'd like to, to create
connections of likeminded people

00:22:23.027 --> 00:22:25.653
with very different angles and

00:22:25.653 --> 00:22:27.418
to have an interesting situation

00:22:27.418 --> 00:22:29.601
unlike politics or
religion or other things

00:22:29.601 --> 00:22:31.667
where you have a guy who's a pardox

00:22:31.667 --> 00:22:34.361
which then creates fan
bases in opposite directions

00:22:34.361 --> 00:22:37.588
so it's not a complete sheep
game but yet people that can

00:22:37.588 --> 00:22:40.606
actually have empathy for
other people's points of view

00:22:40.606 --> 00:22:43.207
and collaborate, you
now have the beginnings

00:22:43.207 --> 00:22:45.320
of a community that has value to you

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:46.968
that has nothing to do with the person

00:22:46.968 --> 00:22:48.106
that's putting out the content.

00:22:48.106 --> 00:22:51.212
That, my friend, is why
you should be commenting.

