00:25:57.687 --> 00:25:59.800
I'm a 39 year old man.

00:25:59.800 --> 00:26:02.215
You're in your 20's, early, mid-20's.

00:26:02.215 --> 00:26:03.980
Early 20's.

00:26:03.980 --> 00:26:07.369
I know that you and I and
everybody in this room,

00:26:07.369 --> 00:26:09.947
and everybody watching
and listening to the show,

00:26:09.947 --> 00:26:13.290
we all want, we all
think about who we are.

00:26:13.290 --> 00:26:15.682
Social media's been
really interesting to me

00:26:15.682 --> 00:26:17.563
because I think social
media's been the first

00:26:17.563 --> 00:26:21.533
tangible expression of how
everybody wants to PR themselves

00:26:21.533 --> 00:26:22.740
to the world.

00:26:22.740 --> 00:26:24.226
Even the people that poo-poo it

00:26:24.226 --> 00:26:27.407
or try to play too cool for school

00:26:27.407 --> 00:26:29.404
or don't believe in it,

00:26:29.404 --> 00:26:30.240
they don't understand.

00:26:30.240 --> 00:26:33.119
Subconsciously, every
single piece of content

00:26:33.119 --> 00:26:35.604
that every person has ever
put out on social media

00:26:35.604 --> 00:26:39.180
has been absolutely
thought through and is--

00:26:39.180 --> 00:26:41.037
Not like, you're thinking about it.

00:26:41.037 --> 00:26:42.523
It's been thought through subconsciously.

00:26:42.523 --> 00:26:45.077
It is the action end
results of a narrative

00:26:45.077 --> 00:26:46.486
that you've been painting in your mind

00:26:46.486 --> 00:26:48.483
your whole life of who you are.

00:26:48.483 --> 00:26:49.690
Who you want to be.

00:26:49.690 --> 00:26:50.921
The ambition that you want.

00:26:50.921 --> 00:26:53.893
I have outrageous disproportionate want

00:26:53.893 --> 00:26:56.958
to be considered one of the
great businessmen of all time.

00:26:56.958 --> 00:26:59.326
And want to be known about how I did it.

00:26:59.326 --> 00:27:01.625
And they way I treated
people along the way.

00:27:01.625 --> 00:27:04.040
I am very far away from that.

00:27:04.040 --> 00:27:06.547
For as much as you guys love
me and as much as they--

00:27:06.547 --> 00:27:07.685
You have to understand,

00:27:07.685 --> 00:27:09.798
99% of the world has no idea who I am.

00:27:09.798 --> 00:27:12.073
I have still not amassed
the kind of wealth

00:27:12.073 --> 00:27:13.884
that can give me the halo effect

00:27:13.884 --> 00:27:17.762
to talk about being a tangible
execution to that level.

00:27:17.762 --> 00:27:20.781
So, I'm still so far away

00:27:20.781 --> 00:27:24.494
but I know at 80 my
actions are gonna basically

00:27:24.494 --> 00:27:26.282
be the result of my wants.

00:27:26.282 --> 00:27:28.163
And I think you want to be great

00:27:28.163 --> 00:27:29.741
and you've already, at such a young age,

00:27:29.741 --> 00:27:31.971
hit the apex of your career
so you've got a different game

00:27:31.971 --> 00:27:35.871
than I do but I think
along with, he's cocky

00:27:35.871 --> 00:27:39.563
or he's this or she's cocky and she's that

00:27:39.563 --> 00:27:41.606
comes all the stories behind the scenes

00:27:41.606 --> 00:27:42.907
that people don't know.

00:27:42.907 --> 00:27:45.205
That I'm sure, and I'm not sure.

00:27:45.205 --> 00:27:46.993
I hope that behind the scenes

00:27:46.993 --> 00:27:48.642
you're doing these things for fans.

00:27:48.642 --> 00:27:51.939
And behind the scenes when
your competitor beats you,

00:27:51.939 --> 00:27:53.657
even though you've put
everything to it, there's--

00:27:53.657 --> 00:27:56.165
As much as I hate the
Patriots, as much as might

00:27:56.165 --> 00:27:57.790
hate that you got knocked
out of the playoffs.

00:27:57.790 --> 00:28:00.809
Even if you're kinda sour
about it, and I get sour.

00:28:00.809 --> 00:28:04.078
If I lose 11-nothing, I
wouldn't even shake your hand.

00:28:04.078 --> 00:28:05.772
Even though I'm telling you
to shake that person's hand

00:28:05.772 --> 00:28:07.491
in my advice right now.
(laughs)

00:28:07.491 --> 00:28:10.672
It's really there, it's that
respect level to the game.

00:28:10.672 --> 00:28:12.436
I think as long as you respect the game

00:28:12.436 --> 00:28:14.062
and respect, and this
something that I think

00:28:14.062 --> 00:28:15.617
a lot of people struggle with.

00:28:15.617 --> 00:28:18.543
I respect where I'm at right now.

00:28:18.543 --> 00:28:20.261
Because it's the game.

00:28:20.261 --> 00:28:22.885
I could think maybe I'm slightly behind.

00:28:22.885 --> 00:28:25.950
I could think I should be
a little further along.

00:28:25.950 --> 00:28:27.111
I'm just not.

00:28:27.111 --> 00:28:28.365
And it's a net net game.

00:28:28.365 --> 00:28:32.799
I think that you want people
to see you as self-confident

00:28:32.799 --> 00:28:34.448
not egotistical.

00:28:34.448 --> 00:28:36.236
You want people to see
that you're working hard,

00:28:36.236 --> 00:28:38.302
that you're not cheap in the trenches.

00:28:38.302 --> 00:28:40.740
So those actions just have
to be that way, right.

00:28:40.740 --> 00:28:41.994
They just have to be that way.

00:28:41.994 --> 00:28:44.827
So for me, I think you just do you

00:28:44.827 --> 00:28:46.777
and let the chips fall where they may

00:28:46.777 --> 00:28:49.262
and I have funny feeling you're okay

00:28:49.262 --> 00:28:50.980
with what they're saying along the way

00:28:50.980 --> 00:28:52.396
as long as you feel good about it.

00:28:52.396 --> 00:28:54.393
And for me, that's my game too.

00:28:54.393 --> 00:28:56.506
Plenty of people say things

00:28:56.506 --> 00:28:58.503
and I just feel good about it.

00:28:58.503 --> 00:29:00.105
I feel real damn good about it.

00:29:00.105 --> 00:29:01.127
'Cause I'll see you.

00:29:01.127 --> 00:29:02.102
I'll see you soon

00:29:02.102 --> 00:29:03.861
and we'll talk about it.

